n\n算子输入特征说明:\n\n输出与输入Shape一致\nN~N3均可能为非32的整倍数，需要考虑非对齐场景。","https://docs.scipy.org/doc/scipy/reference/generated/scipy.special.fresnel.html#scipy.special.fresnel"],[null,null,"OUTPUT","y","tensor","(N)\n(N,N2,N3)\n(N,N2,N3,N4)","float32,float16,bfloat16",null,"ND",null,null],[4,"GatherV3","INPUT","x","tensor","(N)\n(N,N2,N3)\n(N,N2,N3,N4)\n(N,N2,N3,N4,N5)","int8, float16,int32, float",null,"ND","参考算子：\ntf.gather\n\n算子输入取值范围：\nN∈[1,1024]\nN2∈[1,1024]\nN3∈[200, 200]\nN4∈[200, 1000]\nN5∈[200, 1200]\n\n算子输入特征说明:\n\nN~N5均可能为非32的整倍数，需要考虑非对齐场景。","https://tensorflow.google.cn/api_docs/python/tf/gather?hl=en"],[null,null,"INPUT","indices","tensor","(N)\n(N,N2)\n(N,N2,N3)\n","int32,int32,int32,int32",null,"ND",null,null],[null,null,"INPUT","axis","tensor","(1)\n","int32,int32,int32,int32",null,"ND",null,null],[null,null,"ATTR","batch_dims","int","/","0 <= batch_dims <= min(x.dim, indices.dim)。",0,null,null,null],[null,null,"ATTR","negative_index_support","bool","/","True/False",false,null,null,null],[null,null,"OUTPUT","out","tensor","(N)\n(N,N2,N3)\n(N,N2,N3,N4)\n(N,N2,N3,N4,N5)","int8, float16,int32, float",null,"ND",null,null],[5,"GroupedMatmul","INPUT","x","tensor_list","/","int8,int8",null,"ND","参考算子：\naclnnGroupedMatmulV4\n\n算子输入取值范围：\n输入输出为tensor_list,所有tensor均为2D，M、N、K取值范围为[1,9000]\n\n算子输入特征说明:\n\ntensor_list内每个tensor的shape不同，且每个dim并不一定为32倍数，需要考虑非对齐。\n仅需完成单单单的per-token量化场景功能","https://www.hiascend.com/document/detail/zh/CANNCommunityEdition/82RC1alpha002/API/aolapi/context/aclnnGroupedMatmulV4.md\n\n如涉及调用MatMul高阶api，请安装赛题包内的补丁包。"],[null,null,"INPUT","weight","tensor_list","/","int8,int8",null,"ND",null,null],[null,null,"INPUT","bias","tensor_list","/","int32,int32",null,"ND",null,null],[null,null,"INPUT","scale","tensor_list","/","bfloat16,float32",null,"ND",null,null],[null,null,"INPUT","per_token_scale","tensor_list","/","float32, float32",null,"ND",null,null],[null,null,"INPUT","group_list","tensor","[2]","int64",null,"ND",null,null],[null,null,"ATTR","split_item","